  "Id": "b9be73a1-844b-4d71-9a7f-6cddd90e9132",
  "Description": "Sorts Gaussian splats into an experimental uint index buffer.\n\nUses the same comparison network and camera-view depth as SortGaussianSplats, without materializing sorted Points. Connect the original Points and this output to DrawGaussianSplats.SortedIndices. The output SRV exposes N indices; the internal buffer retains power-of-two capacity.",
